ApiResponse.description:
Standard success envelope.
Every single endpoint returns this.

Example:
    GET /v1/auth/me → ApiResponse[UserProfile]
    {
        "success": true,
        "data": { ...user... },
        "links": { "self": "/v1/auth/me", "actions": [...] },
        "meta": { "request_id": "req_abc", ... }
    }
